# . EasyHybrid extension of pDynamo3 dyff-1.0 (2026-10-08), see atomTypes.yaml. ADDED patterns
#   (marked "EasyHybrid"); dyff-1.0 patterns are unchanged and keep their order:
#     aromatic B (borazine)            -> B:Tri   (dyff-1.0 B patterns require a non-aromatic atom)
#     other B (borane clusters, >= 5 neighbours: no UFF geometry) -> B:Tet
#     aromatic P, 2 connections (phosphinines) -> P:Res (new type)
#     aromatic P, 3 connections (P4, P4S3 cages flagged aromatic by pDynamo) -> P:Tet:+3
#     aromatic Se, 2 connections (selenophenes, selenazoles) -> Se:Res (new type)
#   Bridging hydrogens of boranes are typed by the existing "H:::b" pattern (two connections).
# . DYFF patterns.
# . Order is important with specific before general patterns.
---
# . !MMPatternContainer
Atom Fields:
    - Key
    - Atomic Number
    - Charge
    - Connections
    - Formal Charge
    - Geometry
    - Hydrogens
    - Is Aromatic
    - Is Supporting
    - Oxidation State
    - Atom Type Label
Atom Result Fields:
    - Atom Type Label
    - Charge
Bond Fields:
    - Atom Key 1
    - Atom Key 2
    - Type
Label: DYFF-1.0
